                <pb facs="1414" n="1310" xml:id="pg1310"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Theeapia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-09-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 30, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Peace between Turkey and Bulgaria was signed here yesterday evening.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Philip</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
